#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "A block theme for restaurants, bistros, cafés and bars. Six one-click starter sites, lunch and dinner menus with prices, a reservation form that needs no plugin, opening hours, chef profiles, private dining, a gallery and reviews — eight colour palettes, five type pairings, visitor dark mode and WooCommerce support. Full site editing throughout."
msgstr ""

